        <body>
            <div xml:id="toc">

                <pb facs="0008" n="IV" xml:id="pgIV"/>

                <head>Contents</head>
                <p>(<hi rendition="#small-caps">Note</hi>: For previously published correspondence
                    on relations between the United States and Japan in 1941, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1931-41v01">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, Volumes
                        I</ref> and <ref target="frus:frus1931-41v02">II</ref>. Documents printed in
                    those volumes have not been reprinted in the 1941 annual volumes.)</p>
                <list type="toc">
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pgIII">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Preface</hi>
                        </ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>Efforts to reach a peaceful settlement between the United States and Japan
                        preceding attack by Japan on American territory, December 7: <list>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg1">Chapter I: January 1–April 9, 1941</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg135">Chapter II: April 10–June 22, 1941</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg275">Chapter III: June 22–August 21, 1941</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg389">Chapter IV: August 21–October 2, 1941</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg494">Chapter V: October 2–November 15, 1941</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg600">Chapter VI: November 15–December 7, 1941</ref>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg730">Wartime cooperation among the United States, the
                            British Empire, China, and the Netherlands after December 7; decision of
                            the Soviet Union to remain neutral in the Pacific War</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg774">Consideration of sanctions against Japanese policies of
                            aggression and violation of treaty rights; enforcement of export control
                            system; freezing of Japanese assets in the United States</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg905">Relations of Japan with the Axis Powers and with the
                            Soviet Union</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg1033">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Index</hi>
                        </ref>
                    </item>
                </list>
            </div>
